/// Transform, through the platform's service door. Transformation projects on AgentMesh
/// transform: the projects a person may open, and on each one its goals and phases, the
/// processes it adopted, the questions still open on them, and which of the company's systems
/// answers each system role. Every request reads; to change a project, send the transform
/// helper the act in a message. Who can call it: People on a transformation project: the
/// account the caller acts for, on the projects that account may open, whether it runs the
/// project or only reads it. Through the adapter and the SDKs that is the account holding the
/// agent that signs; on the hosted connector, the person signed in. Cost: Free, and no model is
/// called. Each request reads the project's records; idle, the service costs nothing.
